OL,3,GNEWSANew site planned for endangered
OL,4,Awart-biter cricket
OL,5,
OL,6,FA conservation project has received a
OL,7,Ffunding boost to help save one of
OL,8,FBritain's rarest and most critically
OL,9,Fendangered insects by establishing a
OL,10,Fnew population in Sussex.
OL,12,FA spokesperson for the scheme, headed
OL,13,Fby the charity Buglife, said the
OL,14,Fwart-biter bush crickets were only
OL,15,Ffound in a few sites in the south of
OL,16,Fthe UK.
OL,18,FThe charity added the support from
OL,19,FDefra meant it would help them carry
OL,20,Fout research to identify a new site.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
